# --- never commit -----------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is a set of stow packages, not the whole $HOME: nothing lands
# here without an explicit `git add`. The patterns below are a safety net for
# when that `git add` aims at the wrong directory.

# secrets
.credentials.json
*.pem
*.key
id_*
*cookie*

# shell history (tends to hold secrets typed by mistake)
.zsh_history
.bash_history
.zcompdump*

# state and cache, in case a package ever mirrors those paths
.cache/
.local/state/
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
*~

# Written by nwg-displays on each machine, and deliberately not included by the
# sway config: the monitor arrangement is owned by
# hosts/thinkpad/scripts/Scripts/dock-monitors.
**/sway/outputs
**/sway/workspaces

# third-party clones, cloned by hand at install time (see the README)
.oh-my-zsh/
powerlevel10k/
